      "id": "claim_d0dbdc28078640a29905d8226b9bdc42",
      "statement": "internal/storage is the pure-Go SQLite persistence layer built on modernc.org/sqlite (no cgo); DB wraps *sql.DB plus a cache of prepared statements so Exec/Query/QueryRow and their *Context variants reuse the driver's prepared statement, with the mutex held only across the map update.",
