    {
      "id": "claim_91d17c2a8e5141f19c98929047cfa379",
      "statement": "Parts: ProtocolToPart stores tool parts as the full protocol.ToolState JSON and text/reasoning parts as a fixed 3-key document {text, end, synthetic} (end/synthetic omitted when unset) built by hand on the streamed-delta hot path to stay byte-identical to a sorted-key compact marshal; CallID is transient and not persisted; a marshal failure is an error because persisting an empty string would 500 every later read; PartToProtocol is the inverse.",
